/* Well I have always wanted a way to reply to someone in Email, while
reading a post, or upload etc of theirs. So I wrote the following little
arexx program to do it.

Just install it in your bbsmenu in the post/respond to item section (#5)

IE:

PM, Personal Mail`23|\#0pfiles:PM.rexx\

Mainly I wrote this for a quick way to privatly bitch out users for old
uploads, duplicates, etc.

Well enjoy.

by Shawn McNeece aka Powerslave */
/*CNet Personal Mail     */
options results
gu=getuser;tx=transmit;ss=sendstring
gu 1310210 ; from = result
gu 1310102 ; tit = result
gu 1210100; id = result
ss '\n1Send Private EMail to' from '[ENTER=Yes]? '
getchar;if upper(result) = "N" then do tx '';exit;end
PROMPT  "20" "normal" '\n1\c4Enter subject or press return to use
\c6"'||tit||'"\n1\c5:\q1'
if length(result) > 1 then tit = resp
cleareditor
setmailsubj tit
calleditor ""
if result then do
tx 'Saving Email..'
writemail id
end
else tx 'No mail saved'
